      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "They talked about this in their latest blog post. Basically, it doesn't work because they never actually implemented it. What \"future proofing\" is, is it's where your assets are uploaded to the VRC servers so that they can recompile them for you after each update to auto-fix known issues. They are already considering removing this until they actually implement it on their end.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
